  "question": {
    "text": "Let $\\alpha \\in(0, \\infty)$ and $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}1 & 2 & \\alpha \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right]$. If $\\operatorname{det}\\left(\\operatorname{adj}\\left(2 A-A^T\\right) \\cdot \\operatorname{adj}\\left(A-2 A^T\\right)\\right)=2^8$, then $(\\operatorname{det}(A))^2$ is equal to:",
